<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to TeleHealings</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .header { background-color: #4A90D9; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
    .content { padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .message { font-size: 15px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .cta-button { display: inline-block; background-color: #4A90D9; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
    .footer { padding: 24px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #999999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to TeleHealings</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p class="message">
        We are thrilled to have you on board. TeleHealings connects you with licensed therapists
        for virtual sessions that fit your schedule. Your journey to better mental health starts here.
      </p>
      <p class="message">
        Click the button below to log in and complete your profile setup.
      </p>
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="cta-button">Get Started</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 TeleHealings. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
